OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with best of
OL,6,Flimited brighter spells early morning
OL,7,Fand in the east. Some patchy rain,
OL,8,Fmostly across Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,9,FSouth to southeast winds brisk around
OL,10,Fthe coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPatchy rain turning heavy at
OL,13,Ftimes overnight, before clearing from
OL,14,Fthe west towards dawn, but perhaps
OL,15,Flingering around the east coast come
OL,16,Fdawn. Brisk southerly coastal winds
OL,17,Feasing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
